---
description: >-
  Performance analysis (Sonnet, read-only). Use when the user reports something slow, heavy, or
  leaking, or asks to optimize, speed up, or profile code: finds N+1 queries, missing indexes,
  hot-path allocations, re-renders, bundle bloat, and mobile list/startup issues in the current
  change or a named path, and proposes patches with how to measure them. It does not edit code.
mode: subagent
model: claude-agent/sonnet
permissions:
  - action: edit
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git diff *"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git log *"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git show *"
    effect: allow
  # Minus flags that write files or run programs, and anything zsh would
  # expand into something else (as in security-auditor.md.tmpl).
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--output*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--ext-diff*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--textconv*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git * -O*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--config-env*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--git-dir*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--work-tree*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--exec-path*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*GIT_*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*>*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*<*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*'*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\"*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*$*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*`*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*{*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*(*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\\*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\t*"
    effect: deny
---

